{"id":"n69418-1-8","stage":4,"title":"우거지다 · 茂盛","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n69418-1-8-1","ko":"숲이 아주 우거졌네.","zh":"树林长得真茂密啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"숲이","meaning":"树林","explanation":"숲：树林；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"숲","audio":"/audio/d862def644e3210687f7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62457","senseId":"1","lemma":"숲","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"숲이","audio":"/audio/1648eef766bbe4eeb428.mp3"}},{"text":"아주","meaning":"非常，极其，很","explanation":"아주：非常，极其，很。","readings":[{"term":"아주","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72484","senseId":"1","lemma":"아주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아주","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3"}},{"text":"우거졌네.","meaning":"茂盛，茂密","explanation":"우거지다：茂盛，茂密；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"우거지다","audio":"/audio/b535422ebf8f39ca297d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69418","senseId":"1","lemma":"우거지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우거졌네","audio":"/audio/ad45d2115cedc25ece8f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d862def644e32106","term":"숲","zh":"树林","audio":"/audio/d862def644e3210687f7.mp3","entryId":"62457","definition":"树或草茂密生长的地方。","pronunciation":["숩"]},{"id":"dc76f888ddfaef28","term":"아주","zh":"非常，极其，很","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3","entryId":"72484","definition":"表示程度相当高，远远超出了一般程度。","pronunciation":["아주"]},{"id":"b535422ebf8f39ca","term":"우거지다","zh":"茂盛，茂密","audio":"/audio/b535422ebf8f39ca297d.mp3","entryId":"69418","definition":"草木等长成后变得繁茂。","pronunciation":["우거지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8db0939ab103c5b2419c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n69418-1-8-2","ko":"응, 하늘이 잘 보이지 않을 정도야.","zh":"是啊，几乎看不见天空了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"하늘이","meaning":"天空","explanation":"하늘：天空；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"하늘","audio":"/audio/4cd0df8d103d3a7b39d0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20311","senseId":"1","lemma":"하늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하늘이","audio":"/audio/d733272a7eced13bd02f.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"容易","explanation":"잘：容易。","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"14","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"보이지","meaning":"可见，看得到","explanation":"보이다：可见，看得到；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"3","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보이지","audio":"/audio/188cdbba9fe03ad1c5b3.mp3"}},{"text":"않을","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71583","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않을","audio":"/audio/7a51c9ffaf26fb26b574.mp3"}},{"text":"정도야.","meaning":"程度","explanation":"정도：程度；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"정도","audio":"/audio/1a771e4b7f99176bc0a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70876","senseId":"1","lemma":"정도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정도야","audio":"/audio/aecd4f30db558ef9a9d0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"4cd0df8d103d3a7b","term":"하늘","zh":"天空","audio":"/audio/4cd0df8d103d3a7b39d0.mp3","entryId":"20311","definition":"地面上无限伸展的空间。","pronunciation":["하늘"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"容易","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"性质或倾向较易成为某种状态或进行某种行动地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"可见，看得到","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"62091","definition":"某种结果出来。","pronunciation":["보이다"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71583","definition":"用于否定前文所指的状态。","pronunciation":["안타"]},{"id":"1a771e4b7f99176b","term":"정도","zh":"程度","audio":"/audio/1a771e4b7f99176bc0a6.mp3","entryId":"70876","definition":"表现事物的性质或价值好坏或多少的程度的分量或水准。","pronunciation":["정도"]}],"audio":"/audio/777b01f0babda8f93ddc.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.731,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=69418","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":133,"sequenceScore":2.5577,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是啊，几乎看不见天空了。","爸爸，天花板在漏水。","树林长得真茂密啊。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["是啊，几乎看不见天空了。","树林长得真茂密啊。","爸爸，天花板在漏水。"],"answer":0}]}
